# Routine "Weekly library check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Monday morning, checks the component library and token set for new duplicates, detached instances, and hardcoded values, and reports only what drifted since last week.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/figma-bro && pi -p "/weekly-library-check"
